<section class="comp-intro">
    <h2>Crimson Defense Competition Team</h2>
    <p>Our Competition Team participates in many cyber security competitions, and are always willing to take on new members! If you are interested, stop by one of our meetings on <strong>Thursdays at 6:00pm in the Cyber Lab (Bevill 1066)</strong>. Check out <strong>#comp-announcements</strong> in our <a href="https://forms.gle/8KZW6QKiMKYJYsiv5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> to see what Crimson Defense's Competition Team is currently competing in!</p>
    <h3>Contact our Competition Team Captain in our Discord for more information or if you have any questions!</h3>
</section>

